OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated after commercial
OL,4,Abuilding fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of homes have been evacuated
OL,7,Fafter a fire in a commercial building.
OL,9,FNorthamptonshire Fire and Rescue
OL,10,FService said Alma Street and parts of
OL,11,FGreat Park Street in Wellingborough
OL,12,Fremained closed after crews were called
OL,13,Fto the area at 11:50 GMT.
OL,15,FIt said the fire has been put out but
OL,16,Fthree fire engines remained at the site
OL,17,Fto dampen down hotspots.
OL,19,FThe service advised residents to keep
OL,20,Ftheir windows and doors shut, adding:
OL,21,F"There is likely to be continued
OL,22,Fdisruption this afternoon."
